  "limitations": "Ubuntu qualification uses clean 22.04/24.04 containers, a normal user, Xvfb and software Glow. It covers the installed package, visible PDF rendering, save/reopen, English/French OCR and removal/reinstallation of the same candidate; it does not establish a previous-version Linux upgrade or physical-device qualification. Linux ARM64 is outside this release. Native printing, certificate signing/trust verification, protected Office import and the persistent encrypted visual-signature library remain Windows-only. Session visual signatures and PDF-to-Office exports remain available. Windows packages remain unsigned; Windows ARM64 is cross-built without native execution. Projects updates remain deferred."
